  - `enum PriceDrift { Match, Drift{...}, NotPriced, NotAuditable }` hmm. Simpler: `fn compare_prices(ours: (f64,f64,f64,f64), theirs: (f64,f64,f64,f64), rel_tol: f64) -> Option<PriceDiff>` hmm. I'll specify a shape and let the implementer finalize:
